{
  "sn3.25:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 3.25 ",
  "sn3.25:0.2": "3. Tatiyavagga ",
  "sn3.25:0.3": "Pabbatūpamasutta ",
  "sn3.25:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn3.25:1.2": "Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho rājānaṁ pasenadiṁ kosalaṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn3.25:1.3": "“handa kuto nu tvaṁ, mahārāja, āgacchasi divā divassā”ti? ",
  "sn3.25:1.4": "“Yāni tāni, bhante, raññaṁ khattiyānaṁ muddhāvasittānaṁ issariyamadamattānaṁ kāmagedhapariyuṭṭhitānaṁ janapadatthāvariyappattānaṁ mahantaṁ pathavimaṇḍalaṁ abhivijiya ajjhāvasantānaṁ rājakaraṇīyāni bhavanti, tesu khvāhaṁ, etarahi ussukkamāpanno”ti. ",
  "sn3.25:2.1": "“Taṁ kiṁ maññasi, mahārāja, ",
  "sn3.25:2.2": "idha te puriso āgaccheyya puratthimāya disāya saddhāyiko paccayiko. ",
  "sn3.25:2.3": "So taṁ upasaṅkamitvā evaṁ vadeyya: ",
  "sn3.25:2.4": "‘yagghe, mahārāja, jāneyyāsi, ahaṁ āgacchāmi puratthimāya disāya. ",
  "sn3.25:2.5": "Tatthaddasaṁ mahantaṁ pabbataṁ abbhasamaṁ, sabbe pāṇe nippothento āgacchati. ",
  "sn3.25:2.6": "Yaṁ te, mahārāja, karaṇīyaṁ, taṁ karohī’ti. ",
  "sn3.25:2.7": "Atha dutiyo puriso āgaccheyya pacchimāya disāya …pe… ",
  "sn3.25:2.8": "atha tatiyo puriso āgaccheyya uttarāya disāya … ",
  "sn3.25:2.9": "atha catuttho puriso āgaccheyya dakkhiṇāya disāya saddhāyiko paccayiko. ",
  "sn3.25:2.10": "So taṁ upasaṅkamitvā evaṁ vadeyya: ",
  "sn3.25:2.11": "‘yagghe, mahārāja, jāneyyāsi, 